        "v": 5,
        "title": "Claude Sonnet 4 maxtokens bump and strreplace multi-edit support",
        "summary": "Claude Sonnet 4 replaces 3.6, raising `max_tokens` from 8192 to 32000 in `claude.ts`. `process-str-replace.ts` refactored to accept `oldStrs`/`newStrs` arrays for batched edits, updating `tools.ts` instructions to prefer `write_file` and document `old_{i}`/`new_{i}` syntax. `xml-stream-parser.ts` adds regex param matching via `includesMatch`. Main prompt removes forced `end_turn` and `add_subgoal` requirements.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-15T14:26:43.399Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The code generation tool now uses a more capable model that can produce longer, more detailed responses before needing to stop, so assistants can explain larger tasks in a single reply. A file-editing feature was also rewritten so it can apply several text replacements in one step instead of one at a time, making edits faster and less error-prone. Additionally, the tool now gives clearer guidance to the assistant, preferring one method of writing files over another for routine changes.",
        "model": "vyce/deepseek-v4.1",
