        "title": "Add claude-opus-4-20250514 to relabel pipeline and constants",
        "summary": "claudeModels.opus4 (claude-opus-4-20250514) added to common/src/constants.ts and backend/src/llm-apis/claude.ts. relabelRuns.ts now iterates [sonnet, opus4] for full-file-context relabels, replacing hardcoded claude-3-5-sonnet-with-full-file-context string with dynamic `${model}-with-full-file-context`. relabelWithClaudeWithFullFileContext accepts model parameter; error logging enriched with stack/message fields. Scope: backend admin relabel handler, Claude API message transform, shared constants.",
